{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t亞太經合組織第33次領導人非正式會議，本月中會在深圳舉行。<br/>\n<br/>\n亞太經合組織秘書處執行主任佩德羅薩，接受深圳廣電直新聞專訪時指，中國是全球增長的動力，他期望中國繼續保持開放，與區內經濟體合作，建立更融合、開放及互聯互通的亞太區域。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：朱錫君\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.453126+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T02:21:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T13:37:33.441513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:40.782349+00:00","content_hash":"a63accab49d495ec480817c9ea990a8d9a001cfb62679e3291fb58412ff6edd9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}